docs {
  # Get Total Dana Hibah
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/capaian/stats/dana-hibah`
  
  **Auth Required:** ❌ Public
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil total dana hibah",
    "data": {
      "total": 1500000000,
      "formatted": "Rp1.500.000.000",
      "count": 30
    }
  }
  ```
}
